`GridSlot` is just an alias for `Slot`, so delete it and update the imports. `CellState` with `| string` collapses to plain `string`, so it's better to use `SlotStatus` directly. Also, `any` on `userId` and `meta` should be `string` and `Record<string, unknown>`. Run `tsc --noEmit` after to catch any spots that relied on the loose types.
